  "description": "A globe of map tiles in VL, drawn with Stride from the whole Earth down to street level: raster tile layers, vector tiles from a MapLibre style with labels and 3D buildings, your own geometry on top, and a camera that moves like a map.",
  "id": "VL.Globe",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-28T10:37:42.11Z",
