  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-alpha - The first release. GlobeWindow, a globe in one node, and Globe, the entity for a\n      scene of your own. Layers: OpenStreetMap, XyzTiles, VectorTiles (a MapLibre style: fills, lines,\n      labels, icons, 3D buildings), Geometry, FeatureLayer, Graticule, stacked with Group; TileCache\n      for where tiles are kept. GlobeCamera with drag, wheel, turn and tilt, and FlyTo, CenterOn,\n      ZoomToBounds, ZoomToLevel, ZoomIn, ZoomOut. Pick, ScreenToGlobe, GlobeToScreen, GlobeViewInfo.\n      GlobePositionComponent to stand your own entities on the globe; SunLight to light the buildings\n      and cast their shadows. Requires vvvv gamma 7.4 (.NET 8, Stride 4.2).",
